<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di involvesOperation: questa proprietà collega un'operazione procedurale alle costrizioni letterarie che la comportano. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of involvesOperation: this property relates a procedural operation to the literary constraints that involve it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
